@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

title WF-1: Login Flow (v3.3)

participant "User\n(Browser)" as U #D5E8D4
participant "Core App\n(port 8000)" as CA #DAE8FC
database "core-db\n(PostgreSQL)" as CDB #F5F5F5

== Login Request ==

U -> CA : **POST /api/v1/auth/login**\n(username, password, source_ip, device_fingerprint)
activate CA

CA -> CDB : SELECT user WHERE username
activate CDB
CDB --> CA : user record\n(hash, status, mfa settings)
deactivate CDB

CA -> CA : Verify password (Argon2id)

alt credentials INVALID
    CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=failure)
    CA --> U : **401 Invalid credentials**
    deactivate CA

else account LOCKED/SUSPENDED
    CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=locked)
    CA --> U : **403 Account unavailable**
    deactivate CA

else credentials VALID + MFA DISABLED
    CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=success)
    CA -> CDB : INSERT session\n(token_jti, access_hash,\nrefresh_hash, expires_at)
    note right: core-db.sessions
    CA --> U : **200 OK**\n{access_token, refresh_token}
    deactivate CA

else credentials VALID + MFA REQUIRED
    CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=mfa_required)
    CA -> CDB : INSERT mfa_transaction\n(status=pending)
    note right: core-db.mfa_transactions
    CA --> U : **200 MFA_REQUIRED**\n{mfa_required: true,\nmfa_type: email_otp|sms_otp|totp}
    deactivate CA

    == MFA Verify (chi tiết tại WF-4) ==

    U -> CA : **POST /api/v1/auth/mfa/verify**\n(transaction_id, mfa_code)
    activate CA

    CA -> CDB : SELECT mfa_transaction WHERE id
    activate CDB
    CDB --> CA : transaction record
    deactivate CDB

    CA -> CA : Verify OTP (hash compare)

    alt code INVALID / expired / IP mismatch
        CA -> CDB : UPDATE mfa_transaction\n(status=failed, fail_count+1)
        CA --> U : **401 MFA failed**
        deactivate CA
    else code VALID
        CA -> CDB : UPDATE mfa_transaction\n(status=completed)
        CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=mfa_success)
        CA -> CDB : INSERT session
        CA --> U : **200 OK**\n{access_token, refresh_token}
        deactivate CA
    end
end

note bottom of CA
  **v3.3 Changes:**
  - Core App giao tiếp Detection Engine qua HTTP
  - Login Event KHÔNG gọi detection ngay
  - Detection chạy async qua Outbox Pattern
  - Xem WF-2 để biết chi tiết
end note

@enduml
